# Blackthorn City (and its rooms): HeartGold's SEQ_GS_C_FUSUBE, and this game a song of its own: a proud brass line
# in G minor over a striding harp, a held string chord, a marching bass and a measured drum, a city of stone at the
# foot of the dragons' cliffs. Original composition for this game (plan 20 · J10).
